{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30009_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b7f774b23309d281397e2310fb183a676be8651b29082fe6f59cf20259a139f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd2748a4dfe7331bef4c8c12eefd190e0261d772e17d624cc8157221848aae9d",
      "text": "稍、稍微打扰一下。\n…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:753c3e86c8ebf4813f000912946676be0833503fbb4f78406809d6bac823cf34",
      "text": "……诚司先生？\n怎么一直伸着手，愣在那里不说话了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7a736e366a18bad6529d742ec7c0e0ae0db6a06faaf560800b7bf8e6452eafb",
      "text": "不……我在想该如何向对方搭话，\n一时语塞了。接下来又该做些什么呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5935b602beb71a564ed1419b5777d5b2d90f8564cb286781aa8f427bf9310597",
      "text": "既然这样，干脆把对手戏的对象当成是我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1bd7ad0124e79d4bd78eae37b95a8cd78fb8dc716cf9c8279671cada7a3d510",
      "text": "哈哈，心意我领了。\n不过如果对手是你，可就完全算不上约会了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e9200c8c44ad4fb637dc8c81a3c7a5ab5b8b0ad55fd369229abb24a20ff1de",
      "text": "说的也是呢。啊哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2cb36cc75f7d478a5c5abc4770dee90f43415c155efffffd5f0bab96b0d9897",
      "text": "看样子信玄的情况也差不多啊。再这样下去，\n想拍出所谓的“可靠男友”的感觉可就难了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3985e636aff3805575c111347bfec715dfcea4ea30b9419a3cc2167b020afe",
      "text": "有没有什么好办法呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53546cda52874cc6e7b5bfcb2bffdd2e7ba55ed8deaa21472bb0b4a39982ca87",
      "text": "……不好意思，\n看着各位刚才的样子，我突然想到了一个点子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_e:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a30d35e65eb40d0c5ecc864ea3f2878cd6e75bf2cad484c1229a6949c9e17cc",
      "text": "干脆当作是在“演戏”，各位觉得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
